        Automatic Reviewers Fail to Detect Faulty <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reasoning</span> in Research Papers: A New Counterfactual Evaluation Framework
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dycke%2C+N">Nils Dycke</a>, 
      
