    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Think in Games: Learning to <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reason</span> in Games via Reinforcement Learning with Large Language Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liao%2C+Y">Yi Liao</a>, 
      
