        How Multimodal LLMs Solve Image Tasks: A Lens on Visual Grounding, Task <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reasoning</span>, and Answer Decoding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yu%2C+Z">Zhuoran Yu</a>, 
      
