    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        AI <span class="search-hit mathjax">reasoning</span> effort predicts human decision time in content moderation
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Davidson%2C+T">Thomas Davidson</a>
      
