        IntentionReasoner: Facilitating Adaptive LLM Safeguards through Intent <span class="search-hit mathjax">Reasoning</span> and Selective Query Refinement
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shen%2C+Y">Yuanzhe Shen</a>, 
      
